    "overview": "The Ant Esports MK1300 V2 is a 60% compact mechanical keyboard with 61 keys, ideal for gamers who want fast, linear keystrokes in a space-saving footprint. Its hot-swappable Outemu Red switches deliver a smooth, linear feel with quick actuation, well suited to FPS and fast-paced competitive titles, and can be swapped without soldering for future customization. Per-key RGB backlighting lights up every keycap individually with adjustable effects, while full anti-ghosting and N-key rollover ensure every input is registered accurately during intense gameplay. A detachable 1.5m braided USB-C cable adds durability, and the keyboard is rated for 50 million keystrokes, finished in a sturdy matte-black shell that suits any gaming desk.",
